Unlike all other undead mounts, killing a skeleton horse does not grant the [[Advancement#Monster Hunter|Monster Hunter]] advancement and is not required in order to complete the [[Monsters Hunted]] advancement.<ref name="bug" />
{{load advancements|Best Friends Forever;It Spreads}}

Advancements that apply to all mobs:
{{collapse|content={{load advancements|Take Aim;Arbalistic;A Throwaway Joke;Adventure;Over-Overkill;Mob Kabob}}
}}

